Files derived, with changes
---------------------------
  src/polaris_iceberg/metadata.py
      from iceberg/metadata.py. Configuration now comes from a
      CustomDatabaseConnection rather than the deleted IcebergConnection schema;
      a NameError in the table-load retry handler is fixed; table names are
      taken from the last element of the identifier so nested namespaces do not
      leak into them.

  src/polaris_iceberg/catalog.py
      from iceberg/catalog/rest.py. REST only -- the Glue, Hive and DynamoDB
      catalogs and the factory that chose between them are dropped.

  src/polaris_iceberg/connection.py
      from iceberg/connection.py. The server-side TestConnectionDefinition
      lookup is bypassed, because none is registered for customDatabase.

